WEBVTT

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:11.310
Chiriny, Conquest, Dictatorship, get boring. Sometimes I just get a craving for old fashioned theft.

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:16.450
Wow! We sure cleaned out that knowledge, your scumminess!

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:21.680
Yeah, we stole a lot of swell loot!

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:25.580
Dumbbots, all you got is worthless junk!

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:27.580
Ow!

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.000
Golly. Yeah.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.260
You sure do gots a lot of neat goodies there.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:36.050
Kinda stuff I always wanted.

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:38.250
Scram, you pesky hillbilly.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.540
Okie dokie.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.040
I'll be on my way.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:47.220
Uh, hold on there, my good fellow.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:49.650
This is your lucky day.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.350
Oh, boy.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:52.990
I like lucky days.

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:56.220
I'm willing to part with this whole cart full of wonderful ja--

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.140
I mean, merchandise.

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.000
You can have it for that tiny sack

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:09.760
of dirty gold yay that whole pile of neat stuff for this little old bag no wonder people say I look

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:21.330
just like Santa Claus work Sonic I didn't think he was gonna fall for it just took advantage of

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:28.040
his greed come on little buddy let's return this stuff to its rightful owners

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:35.360
I really put one over on that rube!

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:41.460
This sack of gold can finance a whole army of robot soldiers to trample Mobius into submission.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.460
You're my hero, Dr. Robotnik, sir!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.360
You're rockin' to the core!

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:56.080
Thank you, and to show how much I appreciate you two numbskulls, I'm going to give you a tip.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:57.080
Great!

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.720
Oh boy, a tip!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.000
The tip is:

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:13.840
buy new shoes in the afternoon after your feet have expanded. I want to remember that. Yeah, me too, in case I ever get feet. This nugget alone is worth

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:30.000
strange. Smells like chili beans. It is chili beans, stale chili beans, covered with gold paint. That was a pretty tricky hillbilly.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.000
Coconuts!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.460
You want me, your putrid-ness? You want me?

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:37.970
I was bamboozled by Sonic, and it's all your fault.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:41.730
Move! What are you talking about? I wasn't even there!

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:46.170
Shut up! I'm the boss. I can blame whoever I want.

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:48.730
I'm demoting you down to mop-up duty.

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:49.970
B-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b!

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.280
Where do I start?

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.800
By standing on that X!

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:59.600
Ah!

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:10.040
If it's the last thing I do, I'm gonna get even with that scheme-stopping spine-headed hedgehog.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:16.810
Aren't they the most peaceful, pleasant, harmless couple of old folks you ever saw?

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:20.060
Oh, they sure are! Couldn't harm a fly!

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:26.490
That's why we're gonna attack them! Thanks to my new Ego Artillery attack tank!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:30.000
We're going to blast away the far side of the canyon,

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.540
Sending an avalanche of rocks down on those unsuspecting fogies.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.830
Stop that waving!

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.150
They're the enemy!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.200
But how will we stop Sonic from saving them?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.160
This is the only way into the canyon, and it's booby-trapped.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:48.380
This elastic canyon closer will slow him down,

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:51.480
and when he hits this web of gooey, gunky cords,

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.270
he'll stick like a fly in a spider web.

00:04:56.050 --> 00:05:00.000
Not even Sonic is fast enough to break through these obstacles.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.480
Are we?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:04.000
Of course not. Why do you ask?

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:09.220
Um, 'cause I forgot to fill the gas tank and we're out of fuel!

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.570
No!

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:13.600
That was lucky!

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:17.200
Yeah, we'd have been stuck in that web forever!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:28.800
I wanna catch Sonic so bad, then I can dismantle these stupid robots once and for all!

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.520
Let's get on with it.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.580
Yes, your nastiness!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:36.300
Fire!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:50.670
Hey, you knocked a second off your last time.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.080
Am I ever going to be as fast as you?

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:57.520
Maybe, maybe not, Kade.

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:00.000
But give it your best shot, 'cause if you try your heart,

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.000
whether you end up the best or not, you're a hero.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.020
One more lap now, and you can use your tails this time.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:06.970
SONIC!

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:12.290
This is canceled, kid. This is for real.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:23.910
Come, Sonic, just as I planned!

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:29.700
The Elasticsever!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:44.770
I think this is a trap, but it's not me it's gonna catch you.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.760
You can look now.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.520
It's safe.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:49.520
Sonic.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.420
You saved us.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.440
Hey.

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.440
If I thought you were in any real danger, I would have rushed.

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.390
It's not fair.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.400
That hedgehog's too fast.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.000
Don't worry, you rottenness.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.410
blast another round.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.730
No, you fabricated fool!

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:15.180
Congratulations, Dr. Robotnik, sir.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.400
You sure built great ammunition.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.250
I'm here, Sonic.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.130
Can I help with the rescue?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.750
Sorry, Keed.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.290
Sure could have used your help,

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:27.930
but everything's okay now.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.000
I'm never in time for the final...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.190
stuff. Face it, I'm

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:33.940
a slow-mo. Hey,

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.980
Keats, you're up. You're already

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:38.040
the fastest two-tailed orange fox

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.730
I know. That does it!

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:42.990
I'm never gonna slow that hedgehog

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.590
down enough to catch him!

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:46.710
But you're the most vile,

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.890
mean, evil guy Mobius

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:50.930
has ever seen. You gotta

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.330
slow Sonic down.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.930
No! I'm done trying!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.970
Don't say it, boss!

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.190
Don't give up!

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:00.000
I didn't say I wasn't

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.720
Sonic

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:13.400
That's a relief get slow sonic done. Oh, you're gonna catch him. I'm gonna make my super special sonic search and smash

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:15.400
squad faster

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:22.990
You're gonna make us faster. I have here my latest scientific breakthrough

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:30.000
This is the greatest development in the field of hedgehog

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.560
hunting ever devised.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:36.240
Do you fully grasp the magnitude of what I'm about to show you?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.880
Magnitude?

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.330
Magnitude?

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.240
Uh, that's small, right?

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.210
I mean, to fit in a box.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.420
Small, yes, but precious.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:52.800
A thousand robot miners toiled for years to collect the raw materials.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:09:00.000
It took millions of robot hours to distill enough concentrated compound to create this one-of-a-kind

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:05.680
impossible to duplicate weapon. It's a miracle! It's genius! It's...

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.020
Chewing gum?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:12.990
It's speediment gum. When chewed, it emits Velocity Vibes.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:16.430
Velocity? Vibes?

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:23.110
Yes, whoever possesses my speediment gum gets speed. Enough speed to leave Sonic in the dust.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:30.000
And we possess it! Better not. We got it right here. We're gonna go faster than Sonic!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:38.750
This is the perfect place to test run the speed of ink gum.

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:42.580
You're gonna break the Mobius land speed record today, Gronda!

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.400
I'm ready, you villainousness!

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:48.340
Open wide!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.070
Chew it up!

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:51.070
Good!

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:56.400
Wow! Velocity vibes!

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.640
Now let's see what you can do!

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.650
Go!

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:07.370
I'll let him go!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.250
One lap of Mobius!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.210
This is great!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.210
Uh, Dr. Robotnik, it works!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:15.210
Haha, I'm faster than Sonic!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:19.050
Good! Now use the braking chute and report back!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.880
Yes, sir!

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:24.260
Brake chute! Chute broke!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:26.580
Yeah, brake chute broke!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:42.900
speed

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:52.560
like Sonic

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:53.700
I gotta keep

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:54.220
training

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.070
you gotta

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:56.850
think fast

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:12.380
He was right! Training is really paying all right!

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:17.080
Tell someone...

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:26.890
What hit me? Kidding. Whatever that was, it was going like, uh, me.

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:29.410
It was me! Look!

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:41.900
It's amazing. I mean, that's great. I mean, how'd that happen?

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:47.950
Guess all that training paid off. Race that train.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.030
Don't you think you might be jumping the gun?

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:51.030
Yeah.

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:57.940
Those are three words I thought I'd never hear myself say.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:42.850
I can run fast, I can fly fast, I gotta think!

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:53.450
Get you out before you can shake a leg!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:57.150
Of course it would help if you could shake your leg.

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:59.600
Gene!

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:06.070
I think it's great that you're fast now.

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:07.150
Thanks.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.150
Just don't be in such a hurry to get yourself hurt.

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:11.170
It's not just enough to be fast.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:13.030
You have to learn to be good at fast.

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:15.030
And that takes time and practice.

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:20.380
You know, Keed, there's also a lot of responsibility to being fast.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:21.330
There is?

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:22.540
Sure.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.540
It's not just for showing off.

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:26.360
It's for doing good.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.440
But you show off?

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.730
Yeah, well...

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.350
But only while I'm doing good.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.590
And I'm gonna do good, too.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:34.820
Atta boy.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.480
Because I got a lot of showing off to catch up on.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.100
Dale, slow down.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.600
I'm never gonna get used to saying that.

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:47.060
Lost my speeder mint gum?

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:51.460
You managed to find all of these worthless parts,

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:55.540
but my precious speeder mint gum is lost.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:14:00.000
We looked everywhere, your ruthlessness, honestly.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.800
Watch your mouth! I didn't build you, to be honest!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:10.670
Steal, lie, connive, and harass until you find my speedument gum!

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:14.590
Get it back, your heftiness! We promise!

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:19.490
Don't give me that! I programmed you to break promises!

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:25.520
I'm back, and I'm ready! All I need now is someone to help!

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:30.000
Gee, Sonic never has to wait around to rescue Sonic!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:30.560
Someone?

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:40.820
Need help?

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:46.350
There was trouble!

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:52.070
Hey, your partner, chap!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:55.220
What old bean?

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:58.480
Do nothing of a thought!

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:10.780
You can be so picky about who they let rescue them.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:14.660
Hey, what are you doing?

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:15.970
Yeah.

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:19.100
You pest, you ruin anything!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.090
Huh?

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:24.010
This is the Mobius International Daredevil's competition!

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:28.640
And I was winning the parachute freefall event, but now you made me lose!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.360
Gee, sorry.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:46.900
Hi, any of you seen a little orange fox with 2 tails who's faster than the dickens?

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.900
Yes, he only just ruined our entire event.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:53.790
Friend of his isle!

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:56.680
Me? A friend of a little orange fox with a...

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.640
Uh, never heard of him.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.570
I gotta put the brakes on Tails before he makes any more enemies.

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:11.140
Those robo-goons.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.770
I wonder what they're up to.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:16.040
The Speeder Mint Gum's gotta be here somewhere.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:21.960
Sticky! Nasty and sticky!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.480
I did chew it up real good.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:28.160
Give me a sap.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.240
No, sap!

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:29.800
Stop!

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:34.140
I'm not calling you a sap!

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:35.000
You're not?!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:35.980
No!

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:38.110
I'm calling you an idiot!

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:40.110
Oh, Scratch, you're so sweet!

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:45.340
You look like Sonic!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.360
It was his pesky pal, Tails!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.360
Don't access!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:57.060
Peter mint gum, hey?

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:58.210
So that's it!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.000
Those robo-pops!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:05.860
And he's gonna need me, if I can catch up with him, that is.

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:14.840
No trouble here, either.

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:16.580
It's no fair.

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:19.920
Now that I've got speed, there's nobody to rescue.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:24.020
And I'm not going back to Sonic till I prove myself.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.770
We found the speederman gum, Dr. Robotnik.

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.000
Tails has it.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:36.600
Congratulations! For once, you've almost accomplished your task.

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:38.900
Now put Plan B into action.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.180
Plan B?

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:44.950
Yes, Plan B is bash the brat with the bully.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.360
You boobs!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:49.710
That, I knew it first.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:56.830
Who wants to help somebody?

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:59.280
What's the matter, little girl?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.730
steal my lollipop!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:46.200
Okay!

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:35.640
I came to help you Tails, but I guess I got here a little late, and I hate when that happens.

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:39.600
I'm not fast anymore! I don't know what happened!

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.400
You stepped in some gum.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.550
Huh?

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:43.550
I'll explain it to you later.

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:51.130
Sonic, how come when I got what I always wanted, more than anything else, everything went wrong?

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:54.430
Sometimes you're just not ready for what you want most.

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:59.760
But I bet you'll grow up and you'll be ready. You may even be as fast as me.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.110
I guess.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:02.760
No hurry, though.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.220
But even if you're never as fast as me,

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.250
you're the greatest, Keed.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.850
You're a great flyer, a great guy,

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.140
and above all,

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.270
the greatest friend I could ever hope for.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.170
Thanks, Sonic.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:19.720
Aha! My precious speed-a-mint gum!

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:23.240
It's mine! All mine!

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:41.640
Oh no! I hate turtles! I hate tails! I hate that hedgehog!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:53.270
Wow! Look at me go! Where's that hair? I'm ready to race! I'm a speed demon! I'm fast! Wow!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:06.080
Smoking is bad for you, you know.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.080
No, it's not.

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.160
Try it.

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:11.210
Whoa, little bro.

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:13.210
That smoke will make you choke.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:15.220
It doesn't make me choke.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:19.030
Smoking is for dumb bots.

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:20.030
It's bad for your health.

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:22.010
And it stains your teeth.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.010
So don't be a fool.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.970
Smoking isn't cool.
